"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">crm lead page</span><span class=\"informations\">806×457 91.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/8/68f84ca3a9bbc462a613dc5c8308bc53727b2d33.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/68f84ca3a9bbc462a613dc5c8308bc53727b2d33\" title=\"helpdesk UI\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/68f84ca3a9bbc462a613dc5c8308bc53727b2d33_2_517x144.jpeg\" alt=\"helpdesk UI\" data-base62-sha1=\"eYBDqjCMDOT2Mh3hgTLJPOLpgs3\" width=\"517\" height=\"144\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/68f84ca3a9bbc462a613dc5c8308bc53727b2d33_2_517x144.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/68f84ca3a9bbc462a613dc5c8308bc53727b2d33_2_775x216.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/68f84ca3a9bbc462a613dc5c8308bc53727b2d33_2_1034x288.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E6E6E6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">helpdesk UI</span><span class=\"informations\">1716×480 94.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/261c04bbb975146a5da1597b5568567af1f074bf.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/261c04bbb975146a5da1597b5568567af1f074bf\" title=\"HR page\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/261c04bbb975146a5da1597b5568567af1f074bf_2_328x250.jpeg\" alt=\"HR page\" data-base62-sha1=\"5r8aJPI5YXsaDPSBVMMb9hJw4hx\" width=\"328\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/261c04bbb975146a5da1597b5568567af1f074bf_2_328x250.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/261c04bbb975146a5da1597b5568567af1f074bf_2_492x375.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/261c04bbb975146a5da1597b5568567af1f074bf_2_656x500.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">HR page</span><span class=\"informations\">804×612 71.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
