      "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:41:11.346Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/girish3\">@girish3</a> both CRM and Desk are evolving separately. We are not sure where this will end up. For v16 and the next 2-3 years, we will continue to evolve desk while CRM and even Frappe Studio start becoming more mature and achieve parity.</p>\n<p>Personally I don’t have an answer to this. We’ll see <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sweat_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":sweat_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sweat_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
