    {
      "id": 487973,
      "username": "anupd",
      "name": "Anup Dhungana",
      "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:25:53.812Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I understand the confusion. But we need a direction.<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/smiley.png?v=14\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Having two UIs at the same time will be troublesome for end users. Since, Frappe UI is the future, I think the Frappe Team should consider replacing desk. This will be a very very large project.</p>",
