      "cooked": "<p>Personally I feel it will be better to integrate all the Frappe UI controls into Desk so one starts getting familiar with the components.</p>\n<p>Secondly it would be necessary to make Frappe Studio to be able to load apps like Frappe CRM and allow editing them down the line. This also means implementing a feature to allow exporting UIs build in Frappe Studio. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rucha_mahabal\">@rucha_mahabal</a> is this feature planned?</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rucha_mahabal\">@rucha_mahabal</a>  This would also mean that Frappe Studio has to also add features to allow users to write server side scripts from withing Studio.</p>",
